From: XinnorLab <135218967+XinnorLab@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 23 Sep 2026 21:54:11 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 07/19] feat(proxy_io): split lookup from create; every DS file
 creation needs a placement admission token

The write, allocate and copy paths no longer open with O_CREAT: a missing backing object goes through the gated ensure helper, a refused creation surfaces as NOSPC.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>
